    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay thanks for the warning. i'm a bit worried though because i'm feeling really lightheaded and my heart won't stop racing since i had some deli meat for lunch. i've had like 3 slices of ham and some swiss cheese today. do you think it's just because i haven't eaten enough carbs or is it something else? i really don't want to go to the er if i can help it.",
